IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1, section 103 (piece dg1):
-- execution, acknowledgment, filing, recording and effective date of the original certificate of
-- incorporation and other instruments. Layer 1: the law, objectively; nobody's point of view.
--
-- Source: de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, a plain-text rendering of the Delaware Code Online, not the
-- official text. `-- src:N | ...` is a slice of line N; an ellipsis means the line goes on.
--
-- Conventions of this module (the reasons are in NOTES.md, Fork register):
--   * the text speaks of "the date and time" of delivery, filing and effect. This module carries the DATE
--     only. Where an answer turns on the time of day within one date, the rule answers NOTHING ("not
--     covered") and says so, and never guesses a time.
--   * "business days" is not defined by the text; a count of business days is a plain input.
--   * the Secretary of State and the Division of Corporations are officials: no seat. What they decide is an
--     input answered conditionally ("..., if the Secretary of State so establishes"); their duties and powers
--     appear here as what they mean for the person who files.

§ `Section 103 -- Execution, acknowledgment, filing, recording and effective date`

§§ `s 103(a) Execution`

-- src:80 | (a) Whenever any instrument is to be filed with the Secretary of State or in accordance with this section or chapter, such instrument shall be executed as follows:
-- src:81 | (1) The certificate of incorporation, and any other instrument to be filed before the election of the initial board of directors if the initial directors were not named in the certificate of incorporation, shall be signed by the incorporator or incorporators (or, in the case of any such other instrument, such incorporator’s or incorporators’ successors and assigns). If any incorporator …
-- src:82 | (2) All other instruments shall be signed:
-- src:83 | a. By any authorized officer of the corporation; or
-- src:84 | b. If it shall appear from the instrument that there are no such officers, then by a majority of the directors or by such directors as may be designated by the board; or
-- src:85 | c. If it shall appear from the instrument that there are no such officers or directors, then by the holders of record, or such of them as may be designated by the holders of record, of a majority of all outstanding shares of stock; or
-- src:86 | d. By the holders of record of all outstanding shares of stock.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(a) (src:80-86)
DECLARE `s 103(a) Instrument` HAS
    `the instrument is the certificate of incorporation`                                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the instrument is to be filed before the election of the initial board of directors`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the initial directors were named in the certificate of incorporation`                        IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:81 | (1) The certificate of incorporation, and any other instrument to be filed before the election of the initial board of directors if the initial directors were not named in the certificate of incorporation, shall be signed by the incorporator or incorporators (or, in the case of any such other instrument, such incorporator’s or incorporators’ successors and assigns). If any incorporator …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(a)(1) (src:81)
DECLARE `s 103(a)(1) Signing by the incorporators` HAS
    `every incorporator signed`                                                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the successors and assigns of the incorporators signed`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `an incorporator is not available`                                                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `a person for whom or on whose behalf the incorporator acted as employee or agent signed`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the instrument states that the incorporator is not available and the reason`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the instrument states that the incorporator in executing the certificate acted as employee or agent for or on behalf of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the instrument states that that person's signature is otherwise authorized and not wrongful` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:82 | (2) All other instruments shall be signed:
