§§ `s 103(d) Effective date`

-- An instrument is effective upon its filing date. It may provide for a later time that is not later than a time
-- on the ninetieth day after the date of its filing (the ninetieth day is inside). A time is "subsequent" to the
-- time of filing: on a later date it is, on the same date it depends on the time of day, which this module
-- does not carry, so the answer is NOTHING (not covered).
-- src:99 | (d) Any instrument filed in accordance with subsection (c) of this section shall be effective upon its filing date. Any instrument may provide that it is not to become effective until a specified time subsequent to the time it is filed, but such time shall not be later than a time on the ninetieth day after the date of its filing. If any instrument filed in accordance with subsection (c) of this section provides for a future effective date or time and if the transaction …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(d) (src:99)
GIVEN `the filing date` IS A DATE
      `the later date the instrument specifies` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 103(d) the instrument may become effective on the specified later date` `the filing date` `the later date the instrument specifies` MEANS
    IF `the later date the instrument specifies` GREATER THAN (`the date` (`period in days` 90) `after` `the filing date`)
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE IF `the later date the instrument specifies` LESS THAN `the filing date`
         THEN JUST FALSE
         ELSE IF `the later date the instrument specifies` EQUALS `the filing date`
              THEN NOTHING
              ELSE JUST TRUE

-- src:99 | (d) Any instrument filed in accordance with subsection (c) of this section shall be effective upon its filing date. Any instrument may provide that it is not to become effective until a specified time subsequent to the time it is filed, but such time shall not be later than a time on the ninetieth day after the date of its filing. If any instrument filed in accordance with subsection (c) of this section provides for a future effective date or time and if the transaction …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(d) (src:99)
GIVEN `the filing date` IS A DATE
      `the later date the instrument specifies` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 103(d) the date on which the instrument is effective` `the filing date` `the later date the instrument specifies` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the later date the instrument specifies`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN JUST `the filing date`
    WHEN JUST later THEN
        CONSIDER `s 103(d) the instrument may become effective on the specified later date` `the filing date` later
        WHEN JUST permitted THEN IF permitted THEN JUST later ELSE NOTHING
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- Terminating or amending an instrument with a future effective date: by filing, prior to the future effective
-- date, a certificate of termination or amendment executed in accordance with subsection (a), identifying the
-- instrument and stating that it has been terminated or the manner in which it has been amended. "Prior to" a
-- date and time: a filing on an earlier date is prior, one on a later date is not, and one on the same date
-- depends on the time of day (NOTHING).
-- src:99 | transaction is terminated or its terms are amended to change the future effective date or time prior to the future effective date or time, the instrument shall be terminated or amended by the filing, prior to the future effective date or time set forth in such instrument, of a certificate of termination or amendment of the original instrument, executed in accordance with subsection (a) of this section, which shall identify the instrument which has been terminated or amended and shall state that the instrument has been terminated or the manner in which it has been …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(d) (src:99)
DECLARE `s 103(d) Certificate of termination or amendment` HAS
    `the date on which the certificate was filed`                                               IS A DATE
    `the certificate was executed in accordance with subsection (a)`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate identifies the instrument which has been terminated or amended`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate states that the instrument has been terminated or the manner in which it has been amended` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:99 | transaction is terminated or its terms are amended to change the future effective date or time prior to the future effective date or time, the instrument shall be terminated or amended by the filing, prior to the future effective date or time set forth in such instrument, of a certificate of termination or amendment of the original instrument, executed in accordance with subsection (a) of this section, which shall identify the instrument which has been terminated or amended and shall state that the instrument has been terminated or the manner in which it has been …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(d) (src:99)
GIVEN c IS A `s 103(d) Certificate of termination or amendment`
      `the future effective date set forth in the instrument` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 103(d) the future effective instrument has been terminated or amended by a certificate in due form and time` c `the future effective date set forth in the instrument` MEANS
    IF NOT (    c's `the certificate was executed in accordance with subsection (a)`
            AND c's `the certificate identifies the instrument which has been terminated or amended`
            AND c's `the certificate states that the instrument has been terminated or the manner in which it has been amended`)
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE IF c's `the date on which the certificate was filed` LESS THAN `the future effective date set forth in the instrument`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE IF c's `the date on which the certificate was filed` GREATER THAN `the future effective date set forth in the instrument`
              THEN JUST FALSE
              ELSE NOTHING

