    IF `the person is substantially and adversely affected by the correction or nullification`
    THEN `the date on which the certificate of correction or corrected instrument was filed`
    ELSE `the date on which the original instrument was filed`

§§ `s 103(g) The Secretary of State is not liable for accepting or filing`

-- src:102 | (g) Notwithstanding that any instrument authorized to be filed with the Secretary of State under this title is when filed inaccurately, defectively or erroneously executed, sealed or acknowledged, or otherwise defective in any respect, the Secretary of State shall have no liability to any person for the preclearance for filing, the acceptance for filing or the filing and indexing of such instrument by the Secretary of State.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(g) (src:102)
DECLARE `s 103(g) Act of the Secretary of State` IS ONE OF
    `preclearance for filing`
    `acceptance for filing`
    `filing and indexing`
    `another act of the Secretary of State`

-- The three acts the text names carry no liability, however defective the instrument; any other act is not covered.
-- src:102 | (g) Notwithstanding that any instrument authorized to be filed with the Secretary of State under this title is when filed inaccurately, defectively or erroneously executed, sealed or acknowledged, or otherwise defective in any respect, the Secretary of State shall have no liability to any person for the preclearance for filing, the acceptance for filing or the filing and indexing of such instrument by the Secretary of State.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(g) (src:102)
GIVEN act IS A `s 103(g) Act of the Secretary of State`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 103(g) the Secretary of State is liable to any person for the act` act MEANS
    CONSIDER act
    WHEN `preclearance for filing` THEN JUST FALSE
    WHEN `acceptance for filing` THEN JUST FALSE
    WHEN `filing and indexing` THEN JUST FALSE
    WHEN `another act of the Secretary of State` THEN NOTHING

§§ `s 103(h) Form of signature`

