-- persons substantially and adversely affected, as to whom it is effective from the date endorsed on the
-- affidavit or waiver (the date of its delivery).
-- src:110 | (3) If the Secretary of State establishes the filing date of an instrument pursuant to this subsection, the date and time of delivery of the affidavit of extraordinary condition or the date and time of the Secretary of State’s written waiver of such affidavit shall be endorsed on such affidavit or waiver and such affidavit or waiver, so endorsed, shall be attached to the filed instrument to which it relates. …
-- src:110 | Such filed instrument shall be effective as of the date and time established as the filing date by the Secretary of State pursuant to this subsection, except as to those persons who are substantially and adversely affected by such establishment and, as to those persons, the instrument shall be effective from the date and time endorsed on the affidavit of extraordinary condition or written waiver attached thereto.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(i)(3) (src:110)
GIVEN `the date the Secretary of State established as the filing date under subsection (i)` IS A DATE
      `the date endorsed on the affidavit of extraordinary condition or the written waiver` IS A DATE
      `the person is substantially and adversely affected by that establishment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DATE
`s 103(i)(3) the date from which the instrument is effective as to the person` `the date the Secretary of State established as the filing date under subsection (i)` `the date endorsed on the affidavit of extraordinary condition or the written waiver` `the person is substantially and adversely affected by that establishment` MEANS
    IF `the person is substantially and adversely affected by that establishment`
    THEN `the date endorsed on the affidavit of extraordinary condition or the written waiver`
    ELSE `the date the Secretary of State established as the filing date under subsection (i)`

§§ `s 103(j) Documents filed before 1 August 2011`

-- src:111 | (j) Notwithstanding any other provision of this chapter, it shall not be necessary for any corporation to amend its certificate of incorporation, or any other document, that has been filed prior to August 1, 2011, to comply with § 131(c) …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(j) (src:111)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 103(j) the date before which a filed document need not be amended to comply with § 131(c)` MEANS YearMonthDay 2011 8 1

-- A document filed before that date need not be amended to comply with section 131(c) (piece dg2). A document
-- filed on or after it that changes the address of a registered office must comply; a document filed on or after
-- it that does not change the address is not mentioned (NOTHING).
-- src:111 | (j) Notwithstanding any other provision of this chapter, it shall not be necessary for any corporation to amend its certificate of incorporation, or any other document, that has been filed prior to August 1, 2011, to comply with § 131(c) of this title, provided that any certificate or other document filed under this chapter on or after August 1, 2011, and changing the address of a registered office shall comply with § 131(c) of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(j) (src:111)
GIVEN `the date on which the certificate or other document was filed` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 103(j) the corporation need not amend the document to comply with § 131(c)` `the date on which the certificate or other document was filed` MEANS
    `the date on which the certificate or other document was filed` LESS THAN `s 103(j) the date before which a filed document need not be amended to comply with § 131(c)`

-- src:111 | (j) Notwithstanding any other provision of this chapter, it shall not be necessary for any corporation to amend its certificate of incorporation, or any other document, that has been filed prior to August 1, 2011, to comply with § 131(c) of this title, provided that any certificate or other document filed under this chapter on or after August 1, 2011, and changing the address of a registered office shall comply with § 131(c) of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 103(j) (src:111)
GIVEN `the date on which the certificate or other document was filed` IS A DATE
      `the certificate or other document changes the address of a registered office` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 103(j) the document must comply with § 131(c)` `the date on which the certificate or other document was filed` `the certificate or other document changes the address of a registered office` MEANS
    IF (`the date on which the certificate or other document was filed` AT LEAST `s 103(j) the date before which a filed document need not be amended to comply with § 131(c)`)
       AND `the certificate or other document changes the address of a registered office`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING
